        "chars": 130,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.01
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        345,
        916,
        1267,
        1040
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 3. The term \"agencies of the City,\" as used in Section 2 hereof, shall mean The City of New York, every county and borough within it and offices thereof, and every administration, department, division, bureau, board or commission of The City of New York; and every corporation, institution or agency of government, the expenses of which are paid in whole or in part by or from the treasury of The City of New York.",
      "logprob_stats": {
